# Files that must not be part of the Vercel (frontend) deployment.
#
# render.yaml   — the Render Blueprint for the backend. Vercel's CLI reads it as
#                 a service definition and tries to build the Python service in
#                 the Node image, which fails. Render reads it from the repo.
# backend/      — the FastAPI app, deployed to Render, not Vercel
# .env          — local dev config, never uploaded
backend/
render.yaml
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
